step Fly to Orgrimmar
  only !Druid
  zone Desolace
  goto 21.6,74.0 "Shadowprey Village flight master"
  fly "Orgrimmar"
  zone Orgrimmar

step Thunder Bluff
  only Druid
  zone Thunder Bluff
  tip Fly from Shadowprey Village to Thunder Bluff and train with Turak Runetotem on Elder Rise; fly on to Orgrimmar from there.
  fly "Thunder Bluff"
  train class

step Back to Orgrimmar
  only Druid
  zone Thunder Bluff
  goto 46.7,49.9 "Thunder Bluff flight master"
  fly "Orgrimmar"
  zone Orgrimmar

step Keldran
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip Keldran stands in the Valley of Spirits on the west side of the city.
  turnin 1436                         -- Keldran

step Orgrimmar trainers
  only Warrior,Hunter,Rogue,Priest,Shaman,Mage,Warlock
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip Train while you are in the city.
  train class

step Zeppelin to Grom'gol
  zone Durotar
  goto 50.7,12.9 "Zeppelin to Grom'gol"

step Fly to Grom'gol
  zone Stranglethorn Vale
  getfp "Grom'gol"
  accept 638                          -- Nimboya: for Arathi, later on the route
  tip The zeppelin lands at the tower on the west side of the camp.
  accept 581                          -- Nimboya
  accept 568                          -- Commander Aggro'gosh
