step Stranglethorn Vale: kill these as you meet them
  zone Stranglethorn Vale
  tip East of the ogres, Shadowmaw Panthers (37-38) stalk unseen until they strike; the Stranglethorn Tigresses roam the same ground and now and then drop a pristine fang. Snapjaw Crocolisks line the river just west of the jungle; keep their skins for Drizzlik.
  tip Careful: Shadowmaw Panthers (level 37-38) and Elder Shadowmaw Panthers (level 42-43) use Sneak while out of combat, so they remain hidden until you get near them.
  collect 3838 quest 570.1
  collect 3839 quest 570.2
