# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Panther Mastery

step Shadowmaw panthers
  tip The Shadowmaw Panthers (37-38) stalk the jungle east of the Mosh'Ogg hills and north-east towards the lake; they strike from stealth. Loot every Green Hills page you find on the way.
  kill 684 quest 192
  kill 1142 quest 569.1

step Venture Co. camp
  tip Head north past Nesingwary's camp to the lake. The Venture Co. Geologists (34-36) work the camps along its western shore; they carry the Tumbled Crystals.
  collect 4106 quest 213

step Mosh'Ogg camp
  tip The Mosh'Ogg ogres camp in the hills just east of Grom'gol. Kill one Brute and one Witch Doctor (36-37); pull them one at a time.
  kill 1142 quest 569.1
  kill 1144 quest 569.2

step Level 36
  when level<36
  zone Stranglethorn Vale
  tip Dustwallow's quests are 35-38. Below 36? Keep killing the Mosh'Ogg Brutes and Witch Doctors here until level 36; pull one at a time. Or, with a group, run the Scarlet Monastery's Graveyard and Library from the Undercity on the next guide's way through.
  goto 36.7,31.9 map 1434 "Mosh'Ogg camp"
  level 36                            -- grind on Mosh'Ogg Brute

